</tr>
<tr>
<td>can_not_be_edited</td>
<td>The transfer is being processed and therefore can no longer be edited</=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>concurrent_update</td>
<td>Another request or process is currently updating this resource. Please =
try again.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>conversion_create_failed</td>
