-4pmh08"><div class=3D"markdown-body"><p>  The following lists the backward=
s-incompatible changes to Airwallex's API.</p>
<p>  To avoid breaking existing integrations, all backwards-incompatible ch=
anges are covered by versioning.  See the previous section for further deta=
ils.</p>
<p>  It includes a list of all affected endpoints to assist in identifying =
any migration work required.  Please refer to the relevant version's docume=
ntation for full details of each affected endpoint's new contract.</p>
<p>  If you have further questions or concerns please contact our support t=
eam.</p>
<h3 style=3D"font-weight: 500; font-size: 24px;">2026-05-29</h3><ul>
<li><p><code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">customer_data_collection.enabled</code> is removed from Billing Checkou=
t APIs. New enum fields <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">customer_data_collection.tax_id</code> and <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">customer_data_collection.billing_address</code> are added.</p>
<p>Affected endpoints:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>POST /api/v1/billing_checkouts/create</strong></li>
<li><strong>GET /api/v1/billing_checkouts/{id}</strong></li>
<li><strong>GET /api/v1/billing_checkouts</strong></li>
<li><strong>POST /api/v1/billing_checkouts/{id}/update</strong></li>
<li><strong>POST /api/v1/billing_checkouts/{id}/cancel</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>Changes:</p>
<ul>
<li><code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">customer_data_collection.enabled</code>: removed</li>
<li><code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">customer_data_collection.tax_id</code>: added enum field (<code style=
=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">DISABLED</code>, <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">OPTIONAL_IF_SUPPORTED</code>, <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">REQUIRED_IF_SUPPORTED</code>; Default: <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">OPTIONAL_IF_SUPPORTED</code>)</li>
<li><code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">customer_data_collection.billing_address</code>: added enum field (<cod=
e style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
