(<strong>Lifecycle =E2=86=92 Card Transaction =E2=86=92 Transaction Event</=
strong>).</p>
<p>Each transaction event represents an individual network message or fund =
movement, with an immutable=20
fund movement per event. Use transaction events when you need per-event=20
details such as failure reasons, authorization subtypes, or individual amou=
nts.</p>
<p><strong>Event types:</strong> <code style=3D"
