><div data-radium=3D"true" style=3D"margin-top: 32px;"><div class=3D"markdo=
wn-body"><p> A dispute occurs when a shopper contests legitimacy of a payme=
nt. <strong>PaymentDispute</strong> APIs will enable you to manage your dis=
pute events removing the need to managing dispute events manually via web-a=
pp, there by reducing your manual efforts.</p>
<p>Combination of a stage &amp; status of a PaymentDispute will indicate th=
e current situation of dispute. You can use our <a href=3D"https://www.airw=
allex.com/docs/payments__disputes__dispute-flow" style=3D"color: #612FFF; f=
ont-weight: 500; overflow-wrap: break-word;">product documentation</a> to u=
nderstand the possible next actions based on stage &amp; status combination=
.</p>
<p>Data Retention Policy: You can query and operate PaymentDispute resource=
s for a maximum of 2 years since creation.</p>
