"true" style=3D"margin-top: 32px;"><div class=3D"markdown-body"><p>A <stron=
g>PaymentIntent</strong> guides you through the process of collecting a pay=
ment from your customer. It tracks a payment when your customer first check=
s out, through to when payment is successfully paid by your customer. A Pay=
mentIntent transitions through a number of states throughout the customer's=
 payment journey. <br><br>You may specify the following on a PaymentIntent.=
</p>
<ol>
<li>How much the payment is for? Denoted by <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">amount</code> and <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">currency</code>.</li>
<li>Who is making the payment? This is described by the optional <code styl=
e=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">customer_id</code> field.</li>
<li>Which PaymentMethod to use? Denoted by <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">payment_method</code>.</li>
</ol>
<p>You/your customer will get back the following hints at different stages =
of the payment process:</p>
<ol>
<li>The available PaymentMethods.</li>
<li>The PaymentMethod attached to this customer (if <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">customer_id</code> is set).</li>
</ol>
<p>A combination of <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">status</code> and <code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">next_action</code> guide you and your customers through the payment pro=
cess, including triggering additional authentication flows as required.<br>=
<br>Data Retention Policy: You can query and operate PaymentIntent resource=
s for a maximum of 2 years since creation.</p>
