markdown-body"><p>Airwallex Hosted Flows enable a Platform to redirect end =
users into Airwallex-hosted web pages to complete a variety of activity flo=
ws. Platforms can deliver hosted flows via a secure, short-lived link uniqu=
e to each connected account. After completion of a flow, the user is redire=
cted back to the platform. Hosted flows are available for <a href=3D"https:=
//www.airwallex.com/docs/api/issuing/transactions#/Scale/Accounts/_api_v1_a=
ccounts_create/post" style=3D"color: #612FFF; font-weight: 500; overflow-wr=
ap: break-word;">accounts created via API</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Currently supported flows:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><code style=3D"
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2f2529;
    background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.1);
    font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  ">onboarding</code> =E2=80=93 <a href=3D"https://www.airwallex.com/docs/s=
cale__create-connected-accounts" style=3D"color: #612FFF; font-weight: 500;=
 overflow-wrap: break-word;">Submit KYC information</a> needed to activate =
the account.</li>
</ul>
<p>Contact your Airwallex Account Manager to start using hosted flows.</p>
<p>Your Account Manager will create a <strong>flow template</strong>, which=
 defines the series of steps the end user will proceed through. Then, you c=
an create a <strong>flow instance</strong> for a particular connected accou=
nt and direct users to the provided URL.</p>
