ting one PSP settlement split for each target account. Once you complete sp=
litting your PSP settlement intent, you can submit it and wait for it to be=
 matched with the associated PSP settlement deposit. The sum of the amounts=
 of the PSP settlement splits of a PSP settlement intent should match the s=
um of the amounts of associated deposits.=20
